        "original_id": "2dd929aa-b6db-504e-86f4-a74857af7278",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Flipper, Lightning Jack, The Lord of the Rings, Casper, Home Improvement\n- People: Paul Hogan, Elijah Wood, Jessica Wesson, Peter Jackson, Zachery Ty Bryan, Cuba Gooding Jr., Beverly D'Angelo\n\nFacts:\n- The 1963 film Flipper inspired a television series that ran from 1964 to 1967.\n- Lightning Jack is a 1994 American-Australian Western comedy film written by and starring Paul Hogan, and it also stars Cuba Gooding Jr. and Beverly D'Angelo.\n- Flipper is a 1996 adventure film remake of the 1963 film of the same name.\n- The 1996 film Flipper stars Paul Hogan and Elijah Wood.\n- Jessica Wesson had supporting roles in the Universal films Casper and Flipper in the 1990s.\n- Jessica Wesson is best known for her recurring role as Jennifer Sudarsky, Brad's first girlfriend, on the sitcom Home Improvement.\n- Elijah Wood is best known for playing Frodo Baggins in Peter Jackson's film trilogy The Lord of the Rings from 2001 to 2003.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
